It does NOT cover the following, which I do not own and have no license to:

* Characters/Kerbal/, Characters/KerbalFemale/, Textures/Kerbal/ and
  Textures/KerbalFemale/: the Kerbals' models, textures and animations. They
  are converted from Kerbal Space Program and remain the property of its
  rights holders (originally Squad, later Take-Two Interactive / Private
  Division and their successors).
* names/: the Kerbal name lists, taken from Kerbal Space Program's crew
  generator; same rights holders.
* Characters/KittenMMU/, Textures/Characters/: the jetpack model, its arm
  animation and textures, copied from Kitten Space Agency, (c) RocketWerkz /
  Ahwoo.

This is a fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by any of them.

